    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Purpose or intended result",
     "texto": [
      "**-도록** can point to the result being sought: 잊지 않다 → **잊지 않도록** (so as not to forget), 일찍 도착하다 → **일찍 도착하도록** (so as to arrive early).",
      "잊지 **않도록** 메모했어요 = I wrote it down so as not to forget it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Instructions and commitments",
     "texto": [
      "**-도록 하다** expresses, depending on the context, making sure to do something or asking for it to be done: 늦지 않도록 하세요 = make sure not to be late. It is not always softer than other instructions."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
